The first local audit caught a real weakness: the obvious coordinate-descent heuristic solved 1 of 8 shipping instances. I’m enlarging the ambient variable space while keeping the certificate under 100 entries and the structural route under 300 XORs, then rerunning the full panel rather than weakening the attack.
